OL,3,GNEWSASecond man who felled Sycamore Gap
OL,4,Atree released
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second of two men who chopped down
OL,7,Fthe Sycamore Gap tree has been released
OL,8,Ffrom prison.
OL,10,FDaniel Graham, 41, from Cumbria, was
OL,11,Fsentenced to four years and three
OL,12,Fmonths for causing criminal damage to
OL,13,Fthe famous tree beside Hadrian's Wall,
OL,14,Fin Northumberland, when he was jailed
OL,15,Flast July last year alongside Adam
OL,16,FCarruthers.
OL,18,FCarruthers was released in April and
OL,19,Fnow Graham has also been freed on
OL,20,Flicence after serving 16 months, plus
OL,21,Fthe time he served on remand.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
