OL,3,GNEWSASecond man who felled Sycamore Gap
OL,4,Atree released
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt sentencing, judge Mrs Justice
OL,7,FLambert told the pair they would serve
OL,8,F40% of the sentence behind bars, with
OL,9,Fthe remainder being served on licence
OL,10,Fin the community.
